capability audio/compressed  a compressed sound decoded: MP3, AAC, FLAC, Vorbis, Opus
  heroes  refused: each is a codec's work, a package of its own below this one as `image/png` stands beside `image`, which hands `audio` the samples it decodes; none of the three yardsticks above decodes one
  go      -
  rust    -
  python  -

dropped
  go      wav.Decoder.Metadata, wav.Metadata, wav.CuePoint, wav.SampleLoop, wav.SamplerInfo, wav.DecodeCueChunk, wav.DecodeListChunk, wav.DecodeSamplerChunk, wav.CIDList, wav.Encoder.Metadata (the metadata chunks of a broadcast or a sampler, which a WAV file carries beside its sound and `decode_wav` passes over); audio.IEEEFloatToInt, audio.IntToIEEEFloat (AIFF's 80-bit float, no WAV's)
